{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32226","headline":"溪上行 · 温庭筠","name":"溪上行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿塘漾漾烟蒙蒙，张翰此来情不穷。\n雪羽䙰褷立倒影，金鳞拨剌跳晴空。\n风翻荷叶一向白，雨湿蓼花千穗红。\n心羡夕阳波上客，片时归梦钓船中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}